{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54853","headline":"兵要望江南 占蛇第十九（京本列第二十一○十二首） 十二 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占蛇第十九（京本列第二十一○十二首） 十二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"下营毕（京本作「军」），遶寨（京本作「蛇遶」）大蛇栖。\n必有贼（京本作「战」）兵来打寨，高强营垒矗（京本作「布」）旌旗，谨慎欲（京本作「好」）防之。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54853.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54853","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}